DESCRIPTION:Heather McMahan is a dynamic actress\, comedian and podcaster k
 nown for her sharp wit and infectious humor. Her two hit stand-up specials\
 , "Son I Never Had" (Netflix) and "Breadwinner" (Hulu) both ascended to the
  top 10 position for seven days. McMahan recently organized\, hosted and he
 adlined the Absolutely Knot comedy cruise themed around her life and person
 ality\, including her comedy shows\, her podcast Absolutely Not!\, and her 
 "Heather Coded" world of luxury and fun. Several thousand of her fevered fa
 ns hit the high seas for the four day cruise from Miami to the Bahamas that
  featured comedians and entertainers curated by McMahan. Heather's relatabl
 e storytelling and charismatic stage presence has captivated audiences and 
 sold-out venues including Radio City Music Hall and Atlanta’s Historic Fo
 x Theatre. Heather is currently on her Bamboozled Tour\, her third national
  tour. Beyond stand-up\, Heather has showcased her talent in acting and has
  become a familiar face as a charismatic red carpet correspondent and host 
 for E!\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & bev
 erage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nThere is 
 a two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, which can be fulfilled with
  any food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and drinks pur
 chased in the bar and lounge do not count towards the two-item minimum.\n\n
